{"created_at": "2026-11-14T05:40:00Z", "created_by": "ai", "from_version": "MARU-EP04-v4", "to_version": "MARU-EP04-v6", "project_id": "MARU-EP04", "items": [{"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfwxbcudx2mfu0w", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "0:42〜0:44 にオープニング（題名）を入れた。v6 で題名を 3 行・内側に。", "new_t": 42.2, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v6", "original_t": 42.2, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "この後にオープニングみたいなの2秒くらい差し込みたい", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfwyncexvczky23", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "人は吹き出しに「morning」（読める○）、機械（画面に目のパソコン）は吹き出しに「？？？」（読めない✕）。", "new_t": 134.1, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v6", "original_t": 132.1, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "人と機械がわかりにくい", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfwzfbhlet7vefy", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "字の形に合わせて上下左右のまん中にそろえた（ほかの枠の字・？の印も全部）。", "new_t": 176.6, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v6", "original_t": 174.6, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "文字が左右高さ中央揃えじゃないのきになる", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfx2nnngcvm8v1o", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "吹き出しのしっぽを、まるロボの方へ向けた。", "new_t": 445.2, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v6", "original_t": 443.2, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "吹き出しのしっぽの位置おかしい", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfx2z40pc5cf368", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "丸をやめ、まるロボが乗っている端っこのマスを、マスの形でふちどる。字幕にかからないよう写し方も直した。", "new_t": 457.4, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v6", "original_t": 455.4, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "まるの位置ずれてる", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfx51sq93cqav2h", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "「ふるまい全体を見る」：門番が足あと全体を照らして見ている絵。「チェック欄なし」：ふつうの買い物の画面の横に、見えない所で上がる人らしさの目盛り。", "new_t": 591.1, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v6", "original_t": 589.1, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "分かりにくい", "reason": ""}]}